<title>INDIA: India RBI mops up 46.86 bln rupees at bond sale.</title>
<headline>India RBI mops up 46.86 bln rupees at bond sale.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it accepted bids for 46.86 billion rupees at a bond sale held earlier in the day.</p>
<p>The bank accepted a total of 91 bids for 46.86 billion rupees at the sale of the 12.59 percent 2004 government of India stock, a central bank spokesperson said.</p>
<p>The issue which opened in the morning was closed at 11.50 a.m, the spokesperson said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
